        "id": 1081223
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-07-18T11:16:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The simplest solution for now would be to add a method to check if the event is supported by the VM and to only send them in such cases, as right now the send*Internal methods also discard some events because they are simply not supported.\n\nWould that be enough for now? vsock failures shouldn\u0027t be that common?",
