      "writtenOn": "2024-07-17T11:17:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "this might not be enough since messages can still be sent to the handler.\nI think stop() can be called before we stop accepting events from the UI, so the try/catch play might still be needed as the thread looper will be dead and sendTarget will then throw.\nI\u0027m not entirely aware of the lifecycle of the VM class so this specific case might not be possible.",
