      "writtenOn": "2024-07-18T10:34:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "sending a message to a dead thread doesn\u0027t cause an exception. It just returns false (with an error log) [1], which is unfortunately ignored by `sendToTarget` [2].\n\nSo, I think this is fine. `send*Event` methods above anyway don\u0027t guarantee the delivery of the events to the VM, or let the client know that the delivery was successful or not. It\u0027s something to be fixed later.\n\n[1] https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:frameworks/base/core/java/android/os/MessageQueue.java;drc\u003d8351712ca1fb7342d27f45727de8dc8d8939c4d3;l\u003d607\n\n[2] https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:frameworks/base/core/java/android/os/Message.java;drc\u003d883887f68f6216285acb07a74975425125644dae;l\u003d471",
